{
  "info": {
    "name": "UmrahMart - Vendor Kelola Order",
    "description": "Postman collection untuk **Kelola Order** vendor (Vendor Order Management).\n\nBase URL: `http://localhost:8080/api/v1`\n\n## Endpoints\n1. **Login Vendor** — dapatkan token (otomatis disimpan)\n2. **List Orders** — `GET /vendors/orders` (daftar order vendor)\n   - Filter: status, search, date_from, date_to\n   - Sorting: sort_by (order_date, customer_name, total_payment), sort_order (asc, desc)\n3. **Export Orders (CSV)** — `GET /vendors/orders/export` (download CSV)\n4. **Detail Order** — `GET /vendors/orders/:orderId`\n5. **Accept Order** — `POST /vendors/orders/:orderId/accept` (paid → processing)\n6. **Ship Order (Input Resi)** — `POST /vendors/orders/:orderId/ship` (processing → shipped)\n7. **Track Waybill (Lacak Resi)** — `GET /vendors/orders/:orderId/tracking`\n8. **Get Invoice (Nota Pesanan)** — `GET /vendors/orders/:orderId/invoice`\n9. **Download Invoice PDF** — `GET /vendors/orders/:orderId/invoice/download`\n10. **Get Shipping Info** — `GET /vendors/orders/:orderId/shipping`\n11. **Reject Order** — `POST /vendors/orders/:orderId/reject` (paid/processing → canceled)\n\n## Flow Normal\n```\nLogin → List Orders (status=paid) → Accept Order → Ship Order (input resi) → Track Waybill\n```\n\n## Flow Reject\n```\nLogin → List Orders (status=paid) → Reject Order\n```\n\n## New Features\n- **Search**: Cari berdasarkan nomor order atau nama pembeli\n- **Date Filter**: Filter berdasarkan tanggal order (date_from, date_to)\n- **Sorting**: Urutkan berdasarkan tanggal, nama, atau total pembayaran\n- **Export CSV**: Download data order dalam format CSV\n- **Invoice/Nota**: Lihat dan download nota pesanan (PDF)\n- **Shipping Info**: Lihat informasi pengiriman dengan timeline tracking\n\n## Auth\nSemua endpoint (kecuali login) membutuhkan **Bearer token** vendor (role: `umkm`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "vendor_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "order_id",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login Vendor",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json.success && json.data && json.data.token) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('vendor_token', json.data.token);",
              "    console.log('✅ vendor_token saved');",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('❌ Login failed, token not saved');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/vendors/login",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "vendors",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"umkm@dev.local\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "Login sebagai vendor (role: umkm) untuk mendapatkan JWT token.\n\nToken disimpan otomatis ke variable `vendor_token`."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. List Orders (Semua)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Has order data', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
              "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array');",
              "});",
              "",
              "if (json.data && json.data.length > 0) {",
              "    var firstOrder = json.data[0];",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', firstOrder.order_id);",
              "    console.log('📦 Total orders: ' + json.data.length);",
              "    console.log('✅ order_id saved: ' + firstOrder.order_id);",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('📭 No orders found');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{vendor_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/vendors/orders?page=1&limit=10",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "vendors",
            "orders"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "page",
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "key": "limit",
              "value": "10"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Mengambil **semua order** milik vendor.\n\n**Query Params:**\n- `page` (int, default: 1) — halaman ke-n\n- `limit` (int, default: 10) — jumlah per halaman\n- `status` (string, optional) — filter status: `paid`, `processing`, `shipped`, `received`, `completed`, `canceled`\n- `search` (string, optional) — cari berdasarkan nomor order atau nama pembeli\n- `date_from` (string, optional) — filter dari tanggal (format: YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `date_to` (string, optional) — filter sampai tanggal (format: YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `sort_by` (string, optional) — urutkan berdasarkan: `order_date`, `customer_name`, `total_payment`\n- `sort_order` (string, optional) — urutan: `asc`, `desc` (default: desc)"
      },
      "response": []
    },
